{
  "_about": [
    "Feat loop, batch 3, lane b3-martial (2026-11-26): rage and its feats, wild shape,",
    "companions, the rogue's strikes and the class-feature strike feats. Each benefit is the",
    "book's (content/feats/feats.json, checked against aonprd.com FeatDisplay 2026-11-26).",
    "New grammar this lane built: `triggers` (rules/feat_events.py: a pool gain on a",
    "critical dealt or taken, or a fall), `precision` (extra precision dice on a blow),",
    "`choice_slots` (a class choice's extra pick), and the defender's once-a-day guards as",
    "`budget` keys read by rules/feat_events.py. Tags name what the engine asks; what still",
    "does not run is each document's `not_yet`."
  ],
